SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    Na 50 charge
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    Cl 100 charge
MIX 1
    1 1.0
    2 1.0
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0.0 0.0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file result.sel
    -temperature
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
